// Sacred Bill Tracker — secrets template (COMMITTED, safe).
// 1. Copy this file to `Secrets.xcconfig` (same folder).
// 2. Replace the placeholder with your real AppsFlyer Dev Key.
// `Secrets.xcconfig` is git-ignored — never commit the real key.
//
// The app reads APPSFLYER_DEV_KEY via Info.plist key "AppsFlyerDevKey" = $(APPSFLYER_DEV_KEY).
// If the value is missing or still a placeholder, AppsFlyer will NOT start (safe no-op).
APPSFLYER_DEV_KEY = paste_real_key_here
